	"descriptionPrefix":"Technically classified as a mining and logistics platform, this Yellowtail command ship pushes the boundaries of just how far the Tichel Merchantile Concern is allowed to arm its private security fleet. In typical fashion, the hull has been modified for more hangar space in place of missile armaments, energy mounts have been added to save on ammunition costs, and fighter LPCs are integrated for streamlined production. Its powerful graviton crane, normally used to load cargo, can also be weaponized to temporarily disrupt enemy ship drives.",
